# Android signing files — intentionally NOT ignored.
# This is a private repo and the team wants keystore.properties
# and the .keystore file committed so the app-signing password
# and key can be recovered from the repo if lost locally.
# If this repo is ever made public, re-add the two lines below
# and rotate the keystore password immediately:
# android/keystore.properties
# android/app/*.keystore
